    "title": "Grayson Allen off injury report ahead of Spurs matchup - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By BAILEY LEASURE ,\n4 hours ago Phoenix Suns guard Grayson Allen is off the injury report ahead of Thursday’s matchup against the San Antonio Spurs. Additionally, Devin Booker and Jalen Green are off the injury report after being out for the Suns’ final game before the All-Star break against the Oklahoma City Thunder on Feb. 11. Isaiah Livers, who has missed the Suns’ last three games due to a shoulder issue, is also off the injury report. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
